msgid "PREBATTLE_TUTORIAL_TOGGLE"
msgstr "Enable this operation's tutorial"
msgid "PREBATTLE_TUTORIAL_TOOLTIP"
msgstr "Show this operation's six-step tutorial outside the map; this setting affects only the selected operation and never changes the hostile plan"
msgid "TUTORIAL_TITLE"
msgstr "PLAYTEST CHECK %d/%d"
msgid "TUTORIAL_SKIP"
msgstr "Skip"
msgid "TUTORIAL_SKIP_TOOLTIP"
msgstr "Close the tutorial without issuing commands or changing battle state; it can be enabled again before the next battle"
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_1_TITLE"
msgstr "Issue a commander objective"
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_1_BODY"
msgstr "Drag any commander card from the right board onto a map region. Why: a commander objective is the shared higher-level order for several cards; each card keeps its formation while moving and engaging together within legal intelligence."
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_1_CONDITION"
msgstr "Pass after acceptance when the authoritative battlefield shows the objective, tasks, and routes. If no card moves, check Decisions for a blocked path or player-controlled card"
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_2_TITLE"
msgstr "Improve theater intelligence"
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_2_BODY"
msgstr "Choose an adjacent region pair below, then request air reconnaissance. Expected: new reports identify source, confidence, and freshness."
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_2_CONDITION"
msgstr "Pass when the receipt is accepted and the intelligence panel shows new reports for both selected regions"
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_3_TITLE"
msgstr "Commit an HQ reserve"
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_3_BODY"
msgstr "Find a reserve card on the right. Drag it to its commander, or deploy near HQ. Expected: the whole card unfolds into real units outside the HQ footprint."
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_3_CONDITION"
msgstr "Pass when the authoritative battlefield starts the deployment countdown; members appear and can leave the base only after it finishes"
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_4_TITLE"
msgstr "Plan a whole-card route"
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_4_BODY"
msgstr "Choose Route / Line on a deployed card, add a waypoint, and confirm. Expected: every member moves together and reforms at the destination."
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_4_CONDITION"
msgstr "Pass when the route is accepted and no member remains at the base or its old position"
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_5_TITLE"
msgstr "Return control to the commander"
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_5_BODY"
msgstr "Choose Return to Commander on the card you took over. After rejoining, every capable member shares nearby targets and neighboring combat cards under the same commander support the fight; Decisions appears only when you must intervene."
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_5_CONDITION"
msgstr "Pass when an authoritative snapshot shows Returning or commander control; the Agent cannot retake control before rejoin completes. Acknowledge never changes the task"
msgid "TUTORIAL_WAITING_CONFIRMATION"
msgstr "Order accepted; waiting for battlefield confirmation. This step completes only after the action takes effect."
msgid "TUTORIAL_REJECTION_HINT"
msgstr "The last action did not take effect: %s"
msgid "TUTORIAL_STEP_6_TITLE"
